"The delivery status of the sent invoices is only followed for the services "
"whose status interface is known. With another service the invoice stays in "
"the Handed over status."
msgstr ""
"Stav doručenia odoslaných faktúr sa sleduje len pri službách, ktorých "
"rozhranie stavov je známe. Pri inej službe ostáva faktúra v stave Odovzdaná."

#. module: l10n_sk_edi_sapi
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_sapi/models/account_move_send.py:0
